CONDITIONAL DRAFT ONLY â€” do not apply while any owned diagnostic/campaign uses live studio source.

Coordinator may consider this patch after serialized A/B establishes effective cadence. This worker ran no tests, engine, import, or patch application. Python tests are new drafts, not PASS evidence. No live studio bytes were changed by this task.

Scope: exactly three production/test files represented by the three *.draft files and cadence.patch. Native SOURCE_PATHS is byte-for-byte untouched at ten entries. No new source/dependency file, .gdignore or marker asset, profile/timeout/settle changes, accepted adapter mutation, or existing batch/index schema change. One supplemental HH_GT06_BENCHMARK_CADENCE stdout record uses validated run/source/profile/PID and records effective EditorSettings plus instantaneous OS low-processor values. NativeLog retains one bounded extra event; existing diagnostic/assembly complete-marker logic is unchanged. This record is readback, not acceptance.

Guard: old output-cap check remains. Before input or INITIALIZE/cycle effects, require exactly four configured editor_overrides keys, exact types and values, and matching effective get_setting values. ConfigFile is necessary to reject missing focused/continuous keys whose default values otherwise coincide. Alias without timers/, wrong value, float/string versus int, integer0 versus boolfalse, unknown extra key and missing key all fail BENCHMARK_EDITOR_CADENCE before effects. ConfigFile is function-local, not retained in benchmark state.

Targeted unit command after safe application (NOT RUN): from 8-9-hh3d-3 run python -B -m unittest studio.tests.replay.test_native_benchmark studio.tests.replay.test_benchmark_assembly studio.tests.replay.test_benchmark_campaign. The three new configuration tests independently parse output, enforce deterministic encoding and reject supplied override sections. They do not execute GDScript and cannot prove native guard behavior.

Required native validation (NOT RUN): positive import round-trip keeps exact generated config bytes; bounded actual editor run emits one matching cadence record, config values typed and OS effective sleep6900, then actual cycle save signal/hash/new-root/generation/readback and clean host/native exits/Jobzero. Test one wrong-key variant (rename focused key to old no-timers name, retain fourkeys) and wrong value/type variants (unfocused100000, focused6900.0 or string, update_continuously0), before sourcefreeze, in separate disposable owned copies. Expect exit86/failure before any cycle/ready/start/batch/semantic effect; retain raw logs and phase/readback. Explain early-exit scan warnings if present; do not label negativecase warning a positive PASS. Default-to-value fallback must not rescue a missing key. No window-focus mutation is required.

The exact profile remains unchanged; any adopted driver/config revision requires new source closure, fresh run identifiers and source-bound diagnostic/campaign evidence. Do not transfer S75 raw captures or critic verdicts. Native handle growth and HTTP statusgap need independent resolution.

